    "Missions: knock down K-Q-J, hit bumpers 12 times, light the three stars, then shoot the Lucky Hole for the jackpot and a 3-ball multiball. Lighting 7-7-7 raises the bonus multiplier (up to ×5) and lights the Lucky Hole for a mystery prize.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务：打倒 K-Q-J → 撞蘑菇柱 12 次 → 点亮三颗星 → 打进幸运洞，开大奖并进入三球齐发。点亮 7-7-7 会提高得分倍数（最高 ×5），并点亮幸运洞的神秘奖。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任務：打倒 K-Q-J → 撞蘑菇柱 12 次 → 點亮三顆星 → 打進幸運洞，開大獎並進入三球齊發。點亮 7-7-7 會提高得分倍數（最高 ×5），並點亮幸運洞的神秘獎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
